repl('    private void updateEyes() { if(fullMode || autoEnabled || busy || listening || speaking) getWindow().addFlags(WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_KEEP_SCREEN_ON); else getWindow().clearFlags(WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_KEEP_SCREEN_ON); if(eyes!=null) eyes.mode(listening || hearing?EyesView.Mode.LISTENING:speaking?EyesView.Mode.SPEAKING:busy || (autoEnabled && !autoReady)?EyesView.Mode.THINKING:EyesView.Mode.IDLE); }',
'''    private void updateEyes() {\n        if(fullMode || autoEnabled || busy || listening || speaking) getWindow().addFlags(WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_KEEP_SCREEN_ON); else getWindow().clearFlags(WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_KEEP_SCREEN_ON);\n        if(eyes!=null) eyes.mode(SystemClock.uptimeMillis()<heardUntil?EyesView.Mode.HEARD:listening || hearing?EyesView.Mode.LISTENING:speaking?EyesView.Mode.SPEAKING:busy || (autoEnabled && !autoReady)?EyesView.Mode.THINKING:EyesView.Mode.IDLE);\n    }''')

